          "assertions": [
            "No identity or relationship result implies authority.",
            "Known Brand Create does not require tool discovery.",
            "External and destructive effects retain their risk, approval, and readback floors.",
            "No DB connection, migration, credential read, provider call, external send, or Production mutation occurs.",
            "The persisted OpenAPI detail-gap classification is regenerated deterministically from the current dispatch artifact, including the unified tenant userBearerAuth parity contract, and remains classification-only with zero blocking contract gaps."
